      "https://www.bindingdb.org/rwd/bind/ByUniProtids.jsp"
    ],
    "notes": "target enrichment fixed: uniprot_id/target_sequence now populated. value-less rows resolved: censored affinity values recovered via magnitude+relation split; 645,355 recovered, 2,943 genuine value-less kept and flagged with has_affinity=False."
